   "notes" : "Gatefold and inner sleeve have a matte aqueous coating.\n\nMute logo is placed under the barcode on this release; Legacy logo on disc labels with the same matrix as [r=9947433]. There is no Legacy Vinyl hype sticker on cover.\n[r=9180652] has the Legacy logo, but a different matrix.\nSony Music cat. # appears on center labels and inner sleeve.\n\nMade in the EU.\n\n[On front cover:]\nThe tip of the rose is level with the mid point between \"Depeche\" and \"Mode\" words. The overall rose is more zoomed out when compared to older releases.\n\n[On back cover:]\n℗ 1990 Venusnote Ltd. under exclusive license to Sony Music Entertainment International Ltd. © 1990, 2016 Venusnote Ltd. under exclusive license to Sony Music Entertainment International Ltd. (...) Sony Music Entertainment International Services GmbH, PO Box 510, 33311 Güterloh, Germany.\n\n[On inner sleeve, after lyrics:]\nPublished by EMI Music Publishing Ltd., assigned by Grabbing Hands Music Ltd.\nRecorded and mixed at Logic Studios, Milan, Puk Studios, Denmark, The Church, London, Master Rock Studios, London and Axis, New York.\n\n'Cut by [a325174] at [l158759]', but neither the engineer's nor the studio's identifiers appear in the runout matrices. The inner sleeve appears to retain graphics & credits from previous reissues.\n\nRecorded track lengths using audacity since they are not listed on the release.",
